{title: Tera Hi Rahun}
{artist: Gajendra Verma}
{key: C}

{c: Verse 1}
Main [C]tera hi [D]rahun,        Tu [C]meri hi [D]rahe
Na [C]ho ye [D]faasle oh meri [G]jaana,        [C]Kahin bhi tu [D]rahe
[C]Kahin bhi main [D]rahun,        Na [C]toote ye [D]hosle saath [G]nibhana
Mil [C]gaya, mil [D]gaya, mera [G]jahan,        Ho [C]gaya, ho [D]gaya, tu jo [G]mera
[C]Mohabbat ke [D]safar,        Ka [C]raahi umra [D]bhar
Main [C]ban jaunga [D]agar, tu ho [G]rasta,        [C]Siyahi se waqt [D]ki
[C]Dilon ke vark [D]par,        [C]Likhte [D]jayenge apni [G]daastan
Mil [C]gaya, mil [D]gaya, mera [G]jahan,        Ho [C]gaya, ho [D]gaya, tu jo [G]mera
Mil [C]gaya, mil [D]gaya, mera [G]jahan,        Ho [C]gaya, ho [D]gaya, tu jo [G]mera
Tu [C]sooraj ki dhoop [D]hai,        Main [C]sardi ki hoon [D]subah
[C]Mere har ik marz [D]ki tu hai [G]dawa,        Main [C]jab bhi dekh [D]loon
[C]Tujhe kareeb [D]se,        [C]Lage ke mil [D]gaya hai mera [G]Khuda
Tu [C]poora chaand [D]hai,        Main [C]saagar ki [D]lehar
Koi [C]tufan [D]uthe choo loo [G]tuze agar,        Aa [C]lag ja tu [D]gale
[C]Rahe na koi [D]kasar,        Main [C]bhi kuch sawar
[D]jaunga hoga tera [G]asar,        Mil [C]gaya, mil [D]gaya, mera [G]jahan
Ho [C]gaya, ho [D]gaya, tu jo [G]mera,        Mil [C]gaya, mil [D]gaya, mera [G]jahan
Ho [C]gaya, ho [D]gaya, tu jo [G]mera
